   "evidence": "HopfIdeal/Quotient/Basic.lean:318 `noncomputable def quotientIsoOfComapEq (e : H \u2245 K) (I : HopfIdeal R K) {J : HopfIdeal R H} (hI : I.comapOfSurjective e.hom.hom _ = J) : quotient H J \u2245 quotient K I`; :326/:337 its `_hom`/`_inv` mk lemmas; :347 `quotientIsoOfIso_hom_mk`. Conjugation.lean:83 `conjugate_eq_comapOfSurjective : I.conjugate g = I.comapOfSurjective (pointConjugationBialgEquiv g).toBialgHom _`. Unipotent/Radical/NormalSubgroup.lean:71 already uses `CommHopfAlgCat.isoMk (HopfAlgebra.pointConjugationBialgEquiv g)`.",
